@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title System Context — Assessment Application
actor Customer
actor Agent
rectangle "Transaction Dispute Portal" {
  component "Angular SPA" as ui
  component "Spring Boot REST API" as api
  database "PostgreSQL" as db
}
Customer --> ui : View account dashboard and per-account transactions
Agent --> ui : Claim / investigate / resolve
ui --> api : HTTPS JSON envelopes + session cookie\nCSRF on unsafe requests

api --> db : JPA / SQL
note bottom of api
Mock seeded banking transactions
No external bank or payment integration
One modular backend; no MVP API Gateway
TLS reverse proxy / load balancer is a deployment concern
end note
@enduml
